[{"title":"戊辰春如练江奉怀筠社诸友四首 其三","author":"陶益","text":"临流吟望意何其，欲寄王猷逸兴诗。\n翠实弄阴移嶰谷，紫筠流影扫员池。\n湘妃乐奏疑箫管，云母歌传似竹枝。\n竟日相思不相见，濛濛烟雨澹江湄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊辰春如练江奉怀筠社诸友四首 其四","author":"陶益","text":"如练之江潮渐回，轻舟移系钓鱼台。\n林间酒伴何时合，海上诗囊尽日开。\n思有白鸥随客住，恨无青鸟共春来。\n含情欲作潇湘曲，肠断关山忆俊才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"当春即事","author":"陶益","text":"带雨开荒径，临风护竹垣。\n江山长作伴，旦暮共忘言。\n路泞妨车过，门深隔市喧。\n破寒应是酒，潦倒对清樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墩上遣兴","author":"陶益","text":"长吟依林樾，大隐不姓名。\n心远邻犹阔，性狂世亦轻。\n幽花故故作，好鸟关关鸣。\n苦思成诗癖，谁怜太瘦生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨","author":"陶益","text":"潇潇风雨过山房，独对瑶琴未解囊。\n杨柳隔江遥斗舞，芝兰出谷暗流芳。\n浮云捲幔须臾变，细草零阶日夜长。\n老我醉眠人事少，伊谁车马自家忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顺德刘生惠鹤即教扎竹以阑之越月驯戏而赋此","author":"陶益","text":"忽见仙禽顶渐红，一声清叫彻长空。\n却怜万里穿云翼，暂落人间圈套中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听琴","author":"陶益","text":"召客焦桐入夜鸣，虚疑犹有补蝉声。\n当筵渐觉水云起，坐月遥临猿鹤清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书报黄广台附录二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"闻君作宦向长沙，念我贻书到钓槎。\n估客不知词藻重，茫茫喧报鬻鱼虾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书报黄广台附录二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"不见多才鄙吝萌，缄情寄兴恨还生。\n无端昨梦湘潭路，黄鹤楼前月正明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春末忆关念斋五閒亭","author":"陶益","text":"君归新筑五閒亭，象纬曾占此聚星。\n万里烟波浑是梦，百年台榭独为醒。\n柳风淡淡莺声滑，梅雨丝丝草色青。\n安得奋飞同夜集，称心灯火照疏棂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答王太史见忆","author":"陶益","text":"昔侍禁林静，曾趋晓漏寒。\n木天严视草，兰省慎传餐。\n兴剧先吟杜，情欣已识韩。\n江湖今落魄，繫雁寄长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜省中王秀才至","author":"陶益","text":"入港趋潮急，随风觉棹轻。\n乍疑诸客舫，欣见一儒生。\n剑气妆残雨，书囊推画城。\n岂徒通世务，还有下帷情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月皎歌二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"月皎皎兮路茫茫，遥望美人兮天一方，安得假翼兮飞在旁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月皎歌二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"月皎皎兮树苍苍，遥思美人兮不能忘，安得假寐兮梦容光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮酒忆太白","author":"陶益","text":"昔年过采石，明烛拜先生。\n断岸空留月，长江不见鲸。\n怜才皆未已，学醉愧无成。\n何事金龟老，人间得并名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻彭西桥投笔用兵席中有怀","author":"陶益","text":"漫道辞家久，因嗟报国勤。\n兵麾云外见，战角夜中闻。\n入幕推为客，封侯拟是君。\n谁怜张仲侣，对酒借离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和李子扶箕诗","author":"陶益","text":"池边倾盖青莲士，竹杪凌云白鹤仙。\n呼酒未来人已醉，狂吟延伫月空悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中闻吴外翰解任因赋赠别","author":"陶益","text":"梦残鼓角雨濛濛，何事青衿怨别同。\n罢卜三鳣一相送，春风回首绿阴丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鲤化图","author":"陶益","text":"曝腮见角灵光发，簸浪扬云变化生。\n江侧五花难系恋，望霖天下正多情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖中避暑","author":"陶益","text":"投閒避暑犹耽酒，挈榼潜行不告家。\n无客解寻湖上路，有谁同泛柳边槎。\n鼋鼍骤鱼浮空浪，菡萏微风触落花。\n冰水未调萧飒甚，独便幽兴向天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庄居漫兴次何水部韵","author":"陶益","text":"钓罢林塘退食馀，弹歌不羡武昌鱼。\n归来癖病惟寻药，老去穷愁祇著书。\n得意青山如好友，无心到处是閒居。\n何因唤到桑麻长，出见门临上客车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻锡泉舅氏欲解官归先此奉迓","author":"陶益","text":"十年作客分歧路，千里裁诗寄岭梅。\n难和阳春怜隔阔，有缘灯火望归来。\n扁舟已许浮珠海，卓锡应携访玉台。\n怀古思乡情不少，愧无似舅一清才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观凤草此本昔自洪都移植千家","author":"陶益","text":"异卉毵毵向小楼，每逢词客重淹留。\n清魂已断滕王阁，瑞色如存白鹭洲。\n巧萼淡妆偏爱目，翠翘浓抹更宜秋。\n是谁解认为蓂荚，欲往从之叹末由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻遣将南征属意期望","author":"陶益","text":"颦鼓连朝动，烽烟异路生。\n立坛初拜将，横槊尽谈兵。\n短剑挥霜出，长风破浪行。\n来归期不伐，大树更知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"务农","author":"陶益","text":"务农长寓野庐中，过客鸣驺气势雄。\n族党不知豪侠意，井栏团坐说年丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日閒居四首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"城居巷僻人静，池塘日午荷香。\n出逢官吏不识，归与鹭鸥相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日閒居四首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"落落与人难合，寥寥在世无闻。\n樽虚奇字休问，昼永名香自焚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日閒居四首 其三","author":"陶益","text":"一林荔子将熟，并蒂莲花已成。\n游赏愧无高士，诗篇徒有时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日閒居四首 其四","author":"陶益","text":"白酒初酣客散，黄鹂缓啭心閒。\n卖卜已辞朝市，藏书今喜名山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛厓次韵兼酬浚泉郑使君见怀","author":"陶益","text":"逢厓大叫倚青天，望景哀吟吊昔贤。\n烟没隔江谁鼓枻，月悬横浦自敲舷。\n悲凉别路思吴楚，凄断离筵越岁年。\n书札几回添白发，更因临雁益潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈子入闽时有兵乱","author":"陶益","text":"四海风尘半未收，那堪冠剑去悠悠。\n武夷云谷应悬榻，莫问元龙百尺楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"返城南见诏书至有感","author":"陶益","text":"去国留鸿迹，还家狎鹭群。\n城居无识令，畎亩不忘君。\n玉郎开三殿，金函出五云。\n白头逢圣诏，感激复何云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客自励","author":"陶益","text":"送客离杯泪未干，芰荷风雨动微寒。\n青山绿水知多少，谁谓江门行路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇景","author":"陶益","text":"移家钓海槎，荏苒岁云晏。\n木落烟水寒，菰蒲起征雁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"社日醉吟","author":"陶益","text":"薄暮谁将社肉分，阖闾清坐醉醺醺。\n诙谐似欠东方朔，寂寞真成扬子云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起","author":"陶益","text":"起来犹自怯单行，帘捲朝暾廓翠坪。\n四海交游缘病废，千金文字倩谁评。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望圭峰寺","author":"陶益","text":"北望屏前第一峰，禅林龛阁影重重。\n上方得见残径月，下界曾闻半碣钟。\n石磴盘萝藏玉雁，云崖瀑水挂银龙。\n空门想像知无住，玄度还应问赤松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒丁公祠","author":"陶益","text":"丁令鸣琴宪庙时，流声馀韵至今奇。\n沙村过客瞻遗像，墟里怀贤抚旧碑。\n落日鼎烟迷俎豆，疏林灯焰动灵旗。\n郎星错寞空怜汝，泣向秋风奠一卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田父吟二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"田家父老话秋成，白酒黄鸡盛有情。\n旧日梨园都不见，满村惟是打场声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田父吟二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"大醉巡庐击壤歌，不知秋事竟如何。\n健儿忽报菑畬熟，阿母犹嫌荑稗多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见李世卿先生昔寓遗址衋然念之","author":"陶益","text":"昔贤宾馆比丘墟，一望云烟三叹馀。\n秋草已归衡岳雁，寒潭空没楚江鱼。\n微微野径迷人远，寂寂荒台到客疏。\n天地往来吾道在，肯因凋谢更涟如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"河汉阴阴夜寂寥，闺中乞巧拜青霄。\n暂移翠管封蛛网，斜插金钿望鹊桥。\n纤手穿针云影动，露台结彩烛光摇。\n一年一度长相会，纵有离愁亦易消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"经星飞月隔烟萝，百子池前忆素娥。\n扇影渐随秋色改，砧声偏向夜凉多。\n人间此夕成奚事，天上仙槎已渡河。\n儿女欢逢磨喝乐，岂知泪雨又沾梭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题梅田洞用唐人韵","author":"陶益","text":"山洞盘空石齿参，旧游奇绝思难堪。\n六朝芳草迷幽涧，万井寒烟隔翠岚。\n疏影枝枝留月下，暗香岁岁到江南。\n梅田况与匡庐近，飞锡归来梦未酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月十五夜坐即事","author":"陶益","text":"适闻挈榼沽村市，况又援琴对浦沙。\n三五清宵弹皓月，十千美酒醉黄花。\n刚风送暑催秋雁，落木迎寒宿暮鸦。\n独有隐忧人不寐，坐观星斗欲咨嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会试回传容灵先物故为之怅然赋此","author":"陶益","text":"恶说东家少，成名不获年。\n去书犹望答，归意岂堪传。\n雁塔留春梦，麟台负夙缘。\n呦呦闻野鹿，为尔泪潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼阴二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"英英团盖云，轻移遮白日。\n晒发图未成，竹深留六逸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼阴二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"蹲踞芜亭中，望望晴光隔。\n祇愁风雨生，漂此高家麦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鸭篇","author":"陶益","text":"白鸭传来岁月深，主人重之等南金。\n横塘低岸日相逐，八足二螯时并寻。\n缟衣素裳凤髻好，罗袜纯青笛嘴皂。\n谐侣欢呼自己名，倦游默坐王孙草。\n园丁拥彗荔圃中，授餐卜邻事事工。\n斗鸡断隔复几许，驯雉徘徊将无同。\n君不见野性鸱狐俱妄动，至竞难辞弋猎弓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行吟","author":"陶益","text":"行吟瓜地四无邻，恍见长安万斛尘。\n白社果谁能恋旧，青门犹自不嫌贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢病用前韵","author":"陶益","text":"谢病归来少识邻，枕流漱石隔嚣尘。\n惭无白酒堪为醉，赖有青山肯寄贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜见白发二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"昔年虚受染丝方，此日俄经点鬓霜。\n非为愁来生意早，祇缘忧入丈人行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜见白发二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"崇朝出访转须亲，卯酒醉余鹤发新。\n满路元来争认我，方知不在鬓乌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤雁","author":"陶益","text":"孤雁飘飘客异乡，洞庭水落倍悲凉。\n黄芦苦竹去何暮，朔雪寒云飞已长。\n吊影自怜沙上月，鸣声空咽路傍霜。\n白头感汝偏相忆，弟妹萧条老更伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞寿册","author":"陶益","text":"白露横江暑渐稀，脍鲈又是献觞期。\n雁行数向华筵合，鸾步常先彩脉移。\n芝草商山留老凤，玉桃汉室认偷儿。\n问年已料清时事，怀抱逢君可尽披。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夕见邑辅城新整完固肆笔以志喜","author":"陶益","text":"附郭一登临，峨然望不禁。\n戍楼悬夜柝，驿路起寒砧。\n远堞风声树，长濠月色深。\n何人重保障，思与结同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"陶益","text":"晓发行囊越小庄，月沉江阁雾烟黄。\n相看一语出不得，背马悠悠长似忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"陶益","text":"沙渺云长木叶稀，举头又见雁南飞。\n渔翁一路西江艇，经岁经年胡不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日闻鹤","author":"陶益","text":"我屋南窗风更清，时逢仙鹤竹间鸣。\n凭谁传与当途者，何不就阴怀好声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后与陆悬斋观菊","author":"陶益","text":"年来幽事力能支，园菊培成遍接篱。\n蜜蕊露晞裁欲早，香包霜薄拆应迟。\n凝烟秦女窥帘后，衰雨杨妃赐浴时。\n几度携壶贪看尔，莫因佳节苦相疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"视晋孙登传","author":"陶益","text":"一弦清奏似谁论，踪迹飘飘响绝尘。\n汲郡已行长啸客，宜阳聊寄不言人。\n步兵罢叩空回首，中散深惭未识真。\n披卷竟迷君去所，仰山惟见月嶙峋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸣琴","author":"陶益","text":"虚堂正对一横琴，款款焚香意不任。\n三弄梅花添旧恨，广陵散后孰知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藜照亭夜坐","author":"陶益","text":"流萤几点耀空囊，太乙青藜照更光。\n高阁小亭开万卷，疏慵真愧校书郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题游春图","author":"陶益","text":"公子承恩出建章，梅梢遍绿柳丝长。\n当垆春色浓如酒，买醉归来马莫狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澯子入京龙荫承诸公盛赠以言因续四首于卷后 其一","author":"陶益","text":"始射蓬弧缘底事，男儿要作四方奇。\n今朝世烈堂前宴，对酒何须惜别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10104,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澯子入京龙荫承诸公盛赠以言因续四首于卷后 其二","author":"陶益","text":"多年我病归牢落，奕世承恩入梦思。\n自分无能应赖汝，好将忠荩答清时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10105,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澯子入京龙荫承诸公盛赠以言因续四首于卷后 其三","author":"陶益","text":"堤上依依柳色青，骊驹初集此邮亭。\n临行欲授传家剑，出匣犹闻血缕腥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10106,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澯子入京龙荫承诸公盛赠以言因续四首于卷后 其四","author":"陶益","text":"碧海扬帆向玉京，劳劳青简赠离情。\n归来亲友如相谢，莫学前驱负弩行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10107,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵送蔡大理复入京","author":"陶益","text":"月卿自昔依岩廊，金龟银鱼居帝旁。\n入社欲同陶处士，知音何异蔡中郎。\n即看春水鸭头绿，翻忆秋花鹅子黄。\n挥手又从燕北去，官河榆柳正苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10108,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河女章","author":"陶益","text":"即船系柳树，妾家对柳住。\n两岸夹清流，脉脉常相顾。\n相顾不往来，含情空徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10109,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感春","author":"陶益","text":"芭蕉绽裂草蒙戎，榆荚杨花半碧空。\n倦鸟不知春蚤暮，悠然惟自啄青丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张老隐居","author":"陶益","text":"汝家最近江门湾，脩游盘桓云水间。\n煮石舂泉临海屋，栖神导气阅名山。\n邮筒酒熟常时醉，洛社诗成尽日閒。\n此外声华都不管，惟留烟月护松关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":10111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]